    "narrative": "The Austin Waves are positioned for high offensive output today, anchored by **Gunnar Henderson** (81.88) and **Luis Robert Jr.** (75.66), our premier starts. **Gunnar Henderson** enjoys a substantial platoon advantage against Keider Montero, further bolstered by strong park factors, while **Luis Robert Jr.** is primed to capitalize on a favorable matchup against Mart\u00edn P\u00e9rez. We are also leaning heavily into the matchup against Max Scherzer, whose high xERA makes **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (73.61) a high-value play; despite the lower batting order slot, his significant SP-skill bonus and dynamic platoon edge make him an essential start. **Jacob Wilson** (62.19) and **Drake Baldwin** (62.12) round out our top-tier contributors, with **Jacob Wilson** benefiting significantly from park factors and lead-off opportunities against Payton Tolle.\n\nOur roster management remains focused on maximizing efficiency, though the decision to keep **Curtis Mead** (53.86) on the bench was razor-thin. While **Curtis Mead** possesses strong park advantages, the optimizer opted for **Dominic Smith** and **Sam Antonacci** to maintain our overall offensive balance, even as those players faced tougher individual matchups. We are closely monitoring the \"Lineup Pending\" status for all starters, particularly as weather risks and the reliance on historical lineup data introduce volatility. **Heliot Ramos** (58.25) remains a cautious play; while he benefits from a wind-out scenario, his utility is somewhat dampened by an elite holding pitcher, making him a riskier option compared to the stabilized floors of **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (70.22) and **Jorge Polanco** (64.23). Ensure all lineup adjustments are finalized as official cards are posted to protect our game caps.",
